It is always OK to stop and escalate (BLOCKED / NEEDS_CONTEXT).

## Before Reporting Back: Self-Review

- Does it match the Slack layout (user, profile settings, leagues scroll, sign out bottom)?
- Does league tap switch + close drawer?
- Does sign out work?
- Verified against actual component APIs?
- Typecheck + lint clean?

## Report Format

- **Status:** DONE | DONE_WITH_CONCERNS | BLOCKED | NEEDS_CONTEXT
- What you implemented
- What you tested and results
- Files changed
- Self-review findings
- Any issues or concerns

